<title>UK: LME - warehouse stock movements.</title>
<headline>LME - warehouse stock movements.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Jun 03 - Latest LME warehouse stock changes are: copper down 525, tin up 95, lead down 125, zinc down 325, aluminium down 1975, nickel up 12, aluminium alloy down 20</p>
